    section4Title: "What's included and how pricing works",
    section4Body: "What determines the final price for safa tying price in Alibaug comes down to guest count, fabric selection, styling complexity and travel distance if the venue is outside our regular service area. A groom-only booking with a simple fold is at the lower end of the range; a full wedding party package with premium fabric and detailed accessory work is at the higher end — most bookings fall somewhere in between depending on the actual event. Every quote includes the artist's time and full coordination of the tying schedule; fabric can be included in the package or, if you already have fabric chosen, we can quote tying-only pricing instead. Kalgi, brooch and similar accessories are usually priced as optional additions. We'd always recommend sharing your real numbers — date, venue, headcount, fabric preference — rather than asking for a starting price in isolation, since that's what lets us give you something you can actually plan a budget around.",
